  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Aldenham's pond, situated a short stroll from the house, is easily accessible via a well-maintained gravel path, allowing visitors to reach its edge without getting muddy, regardless of the weather.",
      "output_sha256": "8efa8a0d4189a7e7c65a8d9f30a02b31e2598fb54207213b6cb938755ee581c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.353787,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09f9eefb437bd03b0ea4be6586b61b31b502a255674c893a59d2e38348a56641"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8efa8a0d4189a7e7c65a8d9f30a02b31e2598fb54207213b6cb938755ee581c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This makes it possible to gauge the previous night's rainfall by observing the water level.",
      "output_sha256": "06734b0e5558edbc71ff536018ea5ba6b017e485aba793ffe15d8dbf071f3e97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.353787,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09f9eefb437bd03b0ea4be6586b61b31b502a255674c893a59d2e38348a56641"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "06734b0e5558edbc71ff536018ea5ba6b017e485aba793ffe15d8dbf071f3e97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The ribald call it the hippopotamus pond, tracing a resemblance between it and the bath of the hippopotamus at the Zoo, beneath the waters of which, if you particularly desire to point the hippopotamus out to somebody, he always lies hidden.",
      "output_sha256": "15841d7be634ada5e84353bfcc36d8a5d83b9cad0558fefd1131b18eea1b3f08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "15841d7be634ada5e84353bfcc36d8a5d83b9cad0558fefd1131b18eea1b3f08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To the rest of us it is known simply as \"the pond\"—a designation which ignores the existence of several neighbouring ponds, the gifts of nature, and gives the whole credit to the handiwork of man.",
      "output_sha256": "38d4a1bf2e707bb7df9467612e6defb1bf2e31ad45d4d817eed145774639f939",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "38d4a1bf2e707bb7df9467612e6defb1bf2e31ad45d4d817eed145774639f939",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For \"the pond\" is just a small artificial affair of cement, entirely unpretentious.",
      "output_sha256": "1b03da3b568f972a5494c0c748455c66295ef51b91e7cf4d8054ac7e569d1b79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b03da3b568f972a5494c0c748455c66295ef51b91e7cf4d8054ac7e569d1b79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are seven steps to the bottom of the pond, and each step is 10 in. high.",
      "output_sha256": "57ef840c239c5da86cbdcbc8153d8312dcd13e6407f69660ae6cb80970e0aae2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "57ef840c239c5da86cbdcbc8153d8312dcd13e6407f69660ae6cb80970e0aae2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When the water covers three steps, as it did last Monday, it indicates that approximately 40 inches of rain have accumulated since the pond began filling last month.",
      "output_sha256": "6b716c59a8e4fc0ebb10cd6ee45cc9a68267ef4502c5487c64d55edc2f067e5b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.423461,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5118dd1b3934d4075ea316a04e3c56e762b2b9f965554905212ee56c8f0df765"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b716c59a8e4fc0ebb10cd6ee45cc9a68267ef4502c5487c64d55edc2f067e5b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To strangers this may seem surprising, and it is only fair to tell them the great secret, which is that much of the surrounding land drains secretly into the pond too.",
      "output_sha256": "caddf4aa09437f51c890d056d526f1901e1533dd065c51aa79b0d62b23195f97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "caddf4aa09437f51c890d056d526f1901e1533dd065c51aa79b0d62b23195f97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This seems to me to give a much fairer indication of the rain that has fallen than do the official figures in the newspapers.",
      "output_sha256": "d5adfd43d80d8cd81141e07ec362a2899b2472309637675a073ebaa42c2111da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d5adfd43d80d8cd81141e07ec362a2899b2472309637675a073ebaa42c2111da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "After a day of disrupted cricket due to rain, it feels absurd to be told that only .026 of an inch caused the chaos; one yearns for a more dramatic figure.",
      "output_sha256": "19f959c83ca197627cbdee98ef42f04686fc9ca0eec8361def30c5405c108e84",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.396179,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c882449a51f2d7befae4ff8a3565d2c74b701f893b631549cedb8c4382e1a5e2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "19f959c83ca197627cbdee98ef42f04686fc9ca0eec8361def30c5405c108e84",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The pond's record of an additional 5 inches of rain brings a sense of comfort, whereas the dry statistics from a conventional rain gauge would likely frustrate us.",
      "output_sha256": "8676d3001ae8aec363e26547766b309720ef76dcff31abca46233a23e6fa23df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.396179,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c882449a51f2d7befae4ff8a3565d2c74b701f893b631549cedb8c4382e1a5e2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8676d3001ae8aec363e26547766b309720ef76dcff31abca46233a23e6fa23df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It speaks much for my friend Aldenham's breadth of view that he understood this, and planned the pond accordingly.",
      "output_sha256": "176ce079ae7741d45c1b7062ae90fdbf799524fc96bce4ebcdfa13305b3c5577",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "176ce079ae7741d45c1b7062ae90fdbf799524fc96bce4ebcdfa13305b3c5577",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In any country house, it is essential to have a designated meeting area where those who have spent their mornings writing letters can converge with others who prefer not to.",
      "output_sha256": "e5e0b63bbc3cf901abf99327013f5eb3a3771573940ebc38eb7f8250649d0857",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.302083,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "81a54cc13c78d7747c54acc10b126c8bd9a374272ca5b172fb71bc75b9446469"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e5e0b63bbc3cf901abf99327013f5eb3a3771573940ebc38eb7f8250649d0857",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am one of those who cannot write letters in another man's house, and when my pipe is well alight I say to Miss Robinson—or whoever it may be—\"Let's go and look at the pond.\"",
      "output_sha256": "d7b36145e8372289a5339772f1b2a2edbdd497212dff29ad43e68499b7cb63a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7b36145e8372289a5339772f1b2a2edbdd497212dff29ad43e68499b7cb63a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Right oh,\" she says willingly enough, having spent the last quarter of an hour with The Times Financial Supplement, all of the paper that is left to the women in the first rush for the cricket news.",
      "output_sha256": "885c89bbb67fe703a982591884089d93933130ee1a7dfe11b46eb4e7bb9ca452",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "885c89bbb67fe703a982591884089d93933130ee1a7dfe11b46eb4e7bb9ca452",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We wander down to the pond together, and perhaps find Brown and Miss Smith there.",
      "output_sha256": "bbb0dca73ddd3413e303f4b7575976eccb439b1b19647fc209736d40b0c7af33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbb0dca73ddd3413e303f4b7575976eccb439b1b19647fc209736d40b0c7af33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"A lot of rain in the night,\" says Brown.",
      "output_sha256": "45b39ab914268d7f9dc45ab81b098ace48a5de914ea5c32aa6f4561a2c6d4d58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "45b39ab914268d7f9dc45ab81b098ace48a5de914ea5c32aa6f4561a2c6d4d58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"It was only just over the third step after lunch yesterday.\"",
      "output_sha256": "b884b41f2e55f3ec3b8308bb4f70ce9c866059714d3b0e53c4332e4d39e28971",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "b884b41f2e55f3ec3b8308bb4f70ce9c866059714d3b0e53c4332e4d39e28971",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This sparks a friendly debate, with Miss Robinson convinced she stood on the second step that morning, while Miss Smith insists it appears unchanged from her perspective.",
      "output_sha256": "8a93c54458c902d77b4984537fac8e214cb43efc87242ad5f06dfe481371a83d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.487689,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fe43e2647b98ce87bee9115230417a6fa065c55279ef0c83357b0d3af0781477"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a93c54458c902d77b4984537fac8e214cb43efc87242ad5f06dfe481371a83d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "By and by two or three others stroll up, and we all make measurements together.",
      "output_sha256": "07a5ba1d581ea39becda50daecf0e851454fd056ba7468f41d87a376eaf11b8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "07a5ba1d581ea39becda50daecf0e851454fd056ba7468f41d87a376eaf11b8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The consensus is that the rainfall has been significant, with 43 inches recorded over the past three weeks—surely a record.",
      "output_sha256": "2224e3ff87e94e5a3ca9fa282c86dc4d892095543f9d104c824723e538aa748a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.469694,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a60bb7e046b9fd4c829d6c4079c0f44f10c17d70d4d7c1ca744735daafc8e21e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2224e3ff87e94e5a3ca9fa282c86dc4d892095543f9d104c824723e538aa748a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "With that settled, we turn our thoughts to potential activities: lawn tennis, golf, croquet, or something else entirely, as we finalize our plans for the day.",
      "output_sha256": "1dea87ba50c32f8ee1b7f46552a6cab4102d393311c23e2549be9219db3adc9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.254371,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20,
        21,
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "298b4e226fccf8411e0729e73076975f665b3826c193cc3c9db2f4beb0a067df",
        "c47388c994d4c2677baeee064fe6c2363f8286a8efc1d3d9fe1149f334f2e007",
        "b35df58ad82870c3b45eac49e274b8b6d64804ff5acb848108e68a6abf98dc45"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1dea87ba50c32f8ee1b7f46552a6cab4102d393311c23e2549be9219db3adc9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Being outdoors facilitates the organization of our day’s agenda; the fresh air inspires action, and the sight of the newly marked tennis court evokes a desire for redemption following a prior defeat.",
      "output_sha256": "3230747640b79d53d365cb509691ca6c8755770fb0641dd6075195bbd773da76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.318914,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23,
        24,
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9fc1796aef86ec05f3e20172daddb07aa59c7cd1ebbc4781af0b77b3968eee46",
        "1675791646700703e4ae7516fe22b398f9ad85739b5c81cdb57355088e5fc47a",
        "6556b76110d25d235fa454ca65e34f0bf173cac2a8274388004b0161c7495ef7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3230747640b79d53d365cb509691ca6c8755770fb0641dd6075195bbd773da76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But indoors it is so easy to drop into a sofa after breakfast, and, once there with all the papers, to be disinclined to leave it till lunch-time.",
      "output_sha256": "65f9e517dad87f873efa6adc2aeac480d4291aa6ebfe96a9f0071e07eac2f193",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "65f9e517dad87f873efa6adc2aeac480d4291aa6ebfe96a9f0071e07eac2f193",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man or woman as lazy as this must not be rushed.",
      "output_sha256": "108e6509ee90541749f7884ea443308cb1b088cdeb40803bbd9edced57151799",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "108e6509ee90541749f7884ea443308cb1b088cdeb40803bbd9edced57151799",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Say to such a one, \"Come and play,\" and the invitation will be declined.",
      "output_sha256": "0acc9c8035e0a28369d5bad5c00fe4a0d3c8788deb3ad2a35c347ec44592c848",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "0acc9c8035e0a28369d5bad5c00fe4a0d3c8788deb3ad2a35c347ec44592c848",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Say, \"Come and look at the pond,\" and the worst sluggard will not refuse such gentle exercise.",
      "output_sha256": "2e3923d801757fffd545ec810fea5590bdfff408297e536dba28dc936a661857",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e3923d801757fffd545ec810fea5590bdfff408297e536dba28dc936a661857",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And once he is out he is out.",
      "output_sha256": "a11fa124fedce93940de2534280518cf68bdb9802f090e6715a78782e4070a5f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "a11fa124fedce93940de2534280518cf68bdb9802f090e6715a78782e4070a5f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "All this for those delightful summer days when there are fine intervals; but consider the advantages of the pond when the rain streams down in torrents from morning till night.",
      "output_sha256": "e574a2815a02a68aa0f2eee4f871668767d326a41a6199779143a1b83ef81167",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "e574a2815a02a68aa0f2eee4f871668767d326a41a6199779143a1b83ef81167",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How tired we get of being indoors on these days, even with the best of books, the pleasantest of companions, the easiest of billiard tables.",
      "output_sha256": "d5a83eee53d350b5dfbe432bde2263612f4ce7331197ab905a144967e0b90fb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "d5a83eee53d350b5dfbe432bde2263612f4ce7331197ab905a144967e0b90fb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet if our hostess were to see us marching out with an umbrella, how odd she would think us.",
      "output_sha256": "dc4d7be7d25c44e9fd2065728d3dca9f23f98b6d963dddb074f789de0b3947dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
